@startuml skill_name_validation
title Skill Patterns: One Domain Owner for IDs and Names
' Source baseline: pi-mono-java@2c2092f2fa764a7aa7b47da841299f8866d7a151.
' Source evidence: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/skill/SkillLoader.java validateName, loadFromFile.
' Source evidence: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/skill/SkillNamePatterns.java LEGACY_REGEX, STRICT_REGEX.
' Source evidence: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtime/AgentRuntimeManager.java requireSessionLoadable, writeSkills, loadSkill.
' Source evidence: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/agent/RuntimeAgentPromptLoader.java loadSkill.
' Source evidence: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/service/command/SkillCommandSource.java resolved.
' Observed behavior: the baseline loads names with invalid hyphens but excludes them from command discovery.
' Follow-up baseline: pi-mono-java@cf4f929af2d407d3673bfabac0c311831fb570c7.
' Source evidence: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/common/identifier/ResourceIdentifierPatterns.java SKILL_ID_REGEX, SKILL_ID_PATTERN.
' Source evidence: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtime/MateServiceClient.java querySkillInfo.
' Source evidence: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/common/client/HttpMateToolClient.java listSkillTools.
' Architecture change: move Skill ID and name definitions into skill/SkillPatterns; remove old definitions and aliases.
' Target product constraint: remove invalid-name compatibility; SkillPatterns owns NAME_REGEX, NAME_PATTERN and isValidName.
' Design reason: one accepted name set prevents inconsistent loading and discovery without renaming resource identities.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction
component AgentRuntimeManager as Runtime
component RuntimeAgentPromptLoader as Prompt
component SkillLoader as Loader
component SkillCommandSource as Commands
component SkillPatterns as Patterns
component MateServiceClient as MetadataClient
component HttpMateToolClient as ToolClient
Runtime --> Loader : publish and cache reload
Prompt --> Loader : load prompt skills
Loader --> Patterns : isValidName(name)
Commands --> Patterns : isValidName(name)
Runtime --> Patterns : ID_PATTERN
MetadataClient --> Patterns : ID_PATTERN
ToolClient --> Patterns : ID_PATTERN
note bottom of Patterns
ID: skill- followed by 32 hex characters.
Name: 1 to 64 ASCII characters.
Lowercase letters and digits.
Single hyphens separate nonempty groups.
No leading, trailing or repeated hyphens.
end note
note bottom of Runtime
Reject invalid publication.
Preserve the last valid directory on refresh failure.
Reject invalid cache and refetch on prepare.
end note
note bottom of Prompt
Invalid skills are omitted from the prompt.
end note
note bottom of Commands
Invalid names produce no command.
end note
@enduml
